{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36939","headline":"旅舍书怀寄所知二首 二 · 罗隐","name":"旅舍书怀寄所知二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"簟卷两牀琴瑟秋，暂凭前计奈相尤。\n尘飘马尾甘蓬转，酒忆江边有梦留。\n隋帝旧祠虽寂寞，楚妃清唱亦风流。\n可怜别恨无人见，独背残阳下寺楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}